# Only pom.xml and src/ are needed by the Dockerfile. Everything else stays out of the build context, above all
# secrets, local configuration, invoice documents and build output.
*
!pom.xml
!src/
# Belt and braces inside src/: never ship local secrets or documents even if one is placed there by mistake.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.launch
**/*.pdf
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/credentials*.json
**/secrets.properties
**/*-local.properties
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
